  "details": "USN-8883-1 fixed a vulnerability in Go versions 1.18, 1.21, and 1.24. This\nupdate provides the corresponding fix for Go version 1.23.\n\nOriginal advisory details:\n\n It was discovered that the Go x/net/idna package incorrectly handled\n certain Punycode-encoded labels that decoded to ASCII-only labels. An\n attacker could possibly use this issue to bypass hostname-based access\n controls and escalate privileges.",
